"currency, display_desc, tax_rate)) and <b>with_buy_buttons</b>; event page — "
"<b>entry</b> (same shape), <b>event_date</b>, <b>event_time</b>, "
"<b>event_datetime</b> (formatted) and <b>with_buy_buttons</b>. Functions: "
"<b>shop_price(product.price_cents)</b> and <b>shop_buy_url(entry, product)</"
"b> (always runs through the buy-URL filter). display_desc is already "
"sanitized (wp_kses_post) — output it with <b>|raw</b>. Full documentation: "
"https://vollstart.com/event-tickets-with-ticket-scanner/docs/"
msgstr ""

